s caused!And to make things worse, I got 4 negative reviews all at once… WAAAAAH! I'm literally crying my eyes out right now! 😭Anyway, this update also fixes several other bugs and brings some performance improvements and gamepl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T14:14:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042020","verified_at":"2026-10-25T19:02:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1846651706680409","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Update Notes","summary":"Thank you all for your continued support! The game will soon be participating in Steam Next Fest. Come check out the latest version!Steam Next Fest Update NotesMap Improvements: Improved several maps to make exploration and combat smoother.Basic Attack Fix: Fixed an issue where basic attacks could occasionally fail when a character's attack speed was too high.Idol Skill Fix: Fixed an issue that prevented the Idol from attacking enemies while using her singing skill.Reduced Early-Game Difficulty:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:21:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680409","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1845383656388442","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"announcement","title":"The game will be released on November 11","summary":"Thanks for waiting, everyone! The game will officially launch on November 11. Thank you all for your support along the way!Here's what's included in this update:Clothing Update Added 10 brand-new outfits — mix and match however you like.Performance Optimization Optimized how monsters spawn, boosting frame rates by about 10–20 FPS for a smoother experience.Bug Fixes Fixed sudden black screens and display issues across various maps.Thank you all for your encouragement and support!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T05:48:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388442","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1844751498217529","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"announcement","title":"Xbox Controller Support","summary":"Xbox Controller SupportThis update is now live. Thank you all for your support and feedback!1. Xbox Controller Support Completed The game now fully supports Xbox controller input.2. New Cat Interactions Rescued cats now appear in the camp, where you can interact with them in simple ways.3. Cloud Saves Added to Demo The Demo version now supports cloud saves.4. Friends Leaderboard Added A friends leaderboard has been added, so you can compete with your friends.5. Character Balance Adjustments The ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T06:38:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217529","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1842846814450459","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"announcement","title":"5,000 Wishlists!","summary":"5,000 Wishlists!Thank you so much for all your support!99 Day Survival Guide has finally reached 5,000 wishlists on Steam!A huge thank you to everyone who has played the game, added it to their wishlist, shared feedback, or told their friends about it.As an indie developer, this milestone really means a lot to me and gives me even more motivation to keep working on the game!The game will continue to receive updates. There are still lots of things planned, including new characters, equipment, bos","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T09:38:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450459","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1842212951309334","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"update","title":"August 31, 2026 — Game Update & Bug Fixes","summary":"August 31, 2026 — Game Update & Bug FixesThis update mainly improves mouse controls, adjusts several boss mechanics, and fixes a number of issues that could affect the gameplay experience.🎮 Control ImprovementsMouse Sensitivity OptimizationThe in-game mouse sensitivity now matches your computer's mouse settings.You can now adjust your mouse sensitivity directly through your computer's system settings without needing to configure it separately in the game.⚔️ Boss & Balance AdjustmentsThird Map — ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T07:26:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951309334","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1840310314344089","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"update","title":"Update｜August 7, 2026 - Fixes & Improvements","summary":"This update focuses on bug fixes, system optimizations, and adjustments to various gameplay mechanics to provide an even better experience.Bug FixesFixed an issue where monsters could spawn infinitely on the \"Cross-Sea Bridge\" mapFixed an issue where higher difficulties could not be unlocked on the \"Hospital\" mapFixed a mouse control issue when the inventory and card selection screens were opened at the same timeFixed an incorrect leaderboard display when there were not enough playersSystem Opti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T07:55:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314344089","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1839676055890100","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"update","title":"Update Patch｜Aug 1, 2026 – Fixes & Improvements","summary":"Update Patch｜Aug 1, 2026 – Fixes & ImprovementsThis update focuses on bug fixes, balance adjustments, and new content to improve the overall gameplay experience.Bug FixesFixed an issue where enemies could spawn next to the player when near cornersFixed a bug where pets could get enemies stuckFixed unclear projectile behavior for the Shotgun GirlFixed an issue where rats in the Airport map could occasionally disappearFixed incorrect sound effects for equipment dropsBalance & System AdjustmentsSig","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T06:27:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055890100","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1839041357037644","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"announcement","title":"The equipment system beta is now live!","summary":"A brand new equipment system has been added to the game!Now, different characters can mix and match various equipment to create their own unique combat style. Equipment is divided into six quality tiers: Common, Refined, Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Mythic. The higher the quality, the more powerful the stats and growth potential.All equipment must be obtained by defeating powerful bosses. Exploring the map, challenging enemies, and collecting gear will become essential ways to survive in this post","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T08:00:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357037644","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1836506165569374","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"announcement","title":"Outfit System Now Available!","summary":"With this update, I've put together several new outfits for each character. Every character has their own personality — so their style should match too.But in the end, it's up to you — wear whatever you like. Cool, quirky, or just plain good-looking — it's your call.I really hope you find your favorite look — or even a few. You can always switch things up, right?Sure, the apocalypse is serious — but that doesn't mean we have to forget about style, does it? Surviving is important — but looking go","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T01:35:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165569374","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1836506165552840","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"update","title":"Pet System Update – The Cat Bosses Have Arrived!","summary":"Many players have asked the burning question: \"Dogs are great, but where's my cat??\" – Fine, you win. Cats have officially landed in the apocalypse!On the wasteland map, your dog remains that loyal buddy who charges into battle with you. Keep rescuing, keep fighting side by side – they're absolute pros. Cats, on the other hand… Combat ability? Not a chance. They're much better at strolling gracefully through camp, claiming the comfiest corners for naps, and giving your scavenged junk looks of pu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T06:41:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165552840","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1835871199309300","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"update","title":"📢 Update Live | Leaderboards Now Available!","summary":"Each level and every difficulty now has its own Global Top 100 leaderboard. Compete for the best times, climb the rankings, and prove your skills.Challenge yourself—or go head-to-head with your friends.🔥 Can you make it into the Top 100?","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-20T12:51:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199309300","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1835236783566900","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"announcement","title":"New Map \"Cross-Sea Bridge\" is now live!","summary":"In this brand-new map, you are trapped on a long cross-sea bridge— Behind you, an ever-approaching horde of zombies. Ahead, danger lurks as well.There’s no turning back. Only forward.You must find a way out amid the relentless chase, and carve a path to survival caught between both sides.👉 Can you make it off this bridge alive?","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-14T00:42:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783566900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1834602721193272","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"announcement","title":"Pet system is now live!","summary":"You can find trapped dogs on the wasteland map. Once rescued, they will join your team and fight by your side. At the doghouse in your camp, you can switch to your favorite dog at any time (only those that have been successfully rescued).One person and one dog – you don't have to walk the apocalypse alone.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T08:42:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721193272","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1833968530890113","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"announcement","title":"Camp System (Experimental) Added","summary":"Update Notes (Experimental Version)🏕️ New Content1. Camp System (Experimental) Added You can now build basic structures, enhance attributes, and gather resources in the camp. You can also switch characters inside the tent. The camp system will continue to be expanded and improved in future updates.2. Map Selection UI Upgrade The map selection screen has been fully improved. You can now preview the main enemies and possible loot drops for each map, laying the groundwork for the upcoming equipment","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T04:54:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530890113","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1832700592797133","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"announcement","title":"Map 6: “Football Field” is Now Live!","summary":"Hi, I’m Sam.The sixth map — “Football Field” — is now officially live!This time, you’ll enter an arena overrun by infected enemies. While fighting to survive, you must also try to kick the football into the opposing goal and win this “death match.”🆕 Update Contents⚽ New Map: Football FieldDeath Football Mode is now availableComplete objectives by scoring goals during combatA high-pressure battlefield where enemies and match mechanics coexist🔧 Future Development Plans⚙️ Item & Crafting System (In","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-17T23:53:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592797133","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1832700592788316","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"announcement","title":"2026.5.14 Bug修复与更新","summary":"2026.5.14 Bug Fixes and UpdatesAnti-Riot Police Buff: Improved Riot Shield specialization, enhanced Time Bomb skill, and fixed the bug where knockback effect was ineffective.Idol Girl Buff: Improved the ability to make zombies dance. This effect now applies to all monsters except Bosses.Bunny Girl Buff: Card Deal skill gains 2 additional base piercing damage. The Stimulant skill can now have its cooldown reduced by passive skills.Mechanic New Skill: Explosives specialization.Fitness Girl New Ski","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-14T07:35:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592788316","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3850230-1832065502818496","game_id":"steam-3850230","kind":"update","title":"2026.5.10 Update Notes","summary":"2026.5.10 Update NotesBug FixesFixed an issue where players could get stuck in a corner in the butcher shopFixed a bug where the self-destruct remote vehicle did not explodeBalance AdjustmentsSnow Maid enhanced: slow effect can now stack up to 60%, Skill 2 changed to a straight-line fan-shaped attackE-sports Girl enhanced: Electric gun base damage increased by 70%Card skills enhanced: damage of “Power Throw”, boomerang, and football specialization increased by 100%Mechanic AdjustmentsLine-based ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-10T00:51:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcem